acopy audio filter (src/audio/acopy.ts)

src/audio/acopy.ts adapts the acopy filter of FFmpeg libavfilter/af_acopy.c at
commit 946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8: filter_frame allocates an
output buffer of the input's sample count (ff_get_audio_buffer), copies the
frame properties (av_frame_copy_props) and the sample data (av_frame_copy).

af_acopy.c carries no copyright line of its own; it is part of FFmpeg and is
