option, any later version (LGPL-2.1-or-later). The complete license is in
LICENSES/LGPL-2.1-or-later.txt.

The TypeScript adaptation copies every plane into one owned allocation bounded
by maxFrameBytes, observes AbortSignal, keeps samples, pts, layout and rate,
and accepts only the bare token `acopy` (native has no options). Format
negotiation uses the shared 'all' set of the bounded linear chain. FLAC input is
refused. The upstream source is available in the pinned upstream/ffmpeg
submodule. This notice does not assign a license to the whole project or
certify completion of the project-wide license audit.
